 of heat that Goku is  generating in this state and then an  episode 115 as Goku is about to  transform during his battle with calf  law we see him using the ultra instinct  technique to dodge Kepler's attacks  before he fully transforms into this new  form when I first saw this it clicked  for me right away ultra instinct is a  technique that Goku is learning to use  but he is learning to use it with the  help of a new transformation this  transformation has varying degrees which  means that there might be another degree  or level beyond what we've seen so far  Goku's ultra instinct Omen form is more  than just the ultra instinct technique  and if we accept that Goku's ultra  instinct omen goes beyond just a  technique then the question is what is  the true nature of this new form what is  its true power and potential I argued  that this could be the first  transformation in a brand new family of  transformations a form which will have  its own Super Saiyan version just like  the Super Saiyan God form has the Super  Saiyan blue after all we did get some  big hints including the fact that the  word omen means a sign of things to come  so my theory was that ultra instinct  omen is just the first step and that  Goku will attain a new level altogether  and on top of that I speculated that in  this new form  Goku's hair would be silver or white now  the question is why silver instead of  some other color  why would silver hair in particular be  chosen for what might be go coos final  form in Dragon Ball super is there some  meaning behind this color or is it just  random in my previous videos I argued  that there is a clear reason for why the  creators of Dragon Ball super will most  likely decide on silver or white back in  the 1990s after Dragon Ball GT ended a  drawing of a Super Saiyan 5 form fooled  a lot of Dragon Ball fans they thought  that this drawing was a leak from Japan  and that this Super Saiyan 5 form would  be introduced sometime in the future  however 