ue to be  the higher form in this case but here's  the thing the absolutely hottest flames  possible burn a blue-white color they  are blue around the outer edges and  white at the core closest to the source  of the flame so using this flame analogy  in previous videos I predicted that as  Goku moves beyond Super Saiyan blue his  hair will move beyond the color blue and  move closer to white in Dragon Ball  super in particular silver and white  hair has already been established as  something that many powerful characters  possess now Zeno and jiren are both bald  so we can't include them but we know  that the grand priests and the angels  some of the most powerful creatures  other than Zeno himself and also the  masu infused Hamas who all have white  hair the masu also has silver eyes just  like Goku in his ultra instinct form so  again I saw that as a potential clue  about where the creators were heading  when it comes to gold whose final form  so to sum things up the real reason that  Goku hair becomes silver is because  ultra instinct omen the first ultra  instinct formed the goku attains is not  the final ultra instinct form there was  more to Goku's ultra instinct  transformation than we first realized  there was another level to it and in  this higher level his hair turned silver  and why silver instead of some other  color because silver and white have a  lot of symbolic meaning in Japanese  culture and also potentially because of  that whole hottest flame analogy but we  can't know for sure as far as that goes  that's just kind of my own theory now  let me know what you guys think are you  now satisfied that Goku's ultra instinct  goes beyond just a technique and that it  is indeed a full-fledged transformation  also are you happy with the decision to  make go whose hair silver or would you  have preferred a different option and if  you're going to say that you would have  preferred to see something along the  lines of Super Saiyan for happening  super I agree completely  I love the Super Saiyan 4 form I love  the design unfortunately it doesn't look  like we're going to be getting anything  along those lines at least for now  finally do you think that this silver  Goku will be Goku's final form or do you  think that Dragon Ball super will  continue after a hiatus and that  eventually we are going to see even more  forms and even more transformations let  me know down in the comment  if you enjoy the Dragon Ball super  content on this channel be sure to leave  a like to let me know if you're new to  the channel don't forget to subscribe  and hit that notification bell just a  quick note I want to thank all of you  who have been sending us your fan art on  Twitter and Instagram I will try to  feature your art at the end of our  videos and I will include the links to  your social media in the description so  everyone who sees the video can check  you guys out if they're interested  please continue to send us your stuff at  anime uproar on Twitter and Instagram  finally feel free to join us on discord  if you want to discuss anime theories  recommendations and more on a daily  basis as always thank you all so much  for watching and until next time see us  space cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]

